{"beat": 41, "name": "THE OTHER STAIRCASES", "text": "And weight is only the first staircase. The fulfilment fee also changes with the price you charge: the card has edges at $10 and $50, and a price that crosses one moves the whole product onto a different card. For a box over a cubic foot, the card weighs the box itself: length times width times height, in inches, divided by 139, gives a weight in pounds, and the card charges whichever is greater. In 1913, size was a limit. Today it's a price. Storage has a cliff of its own. On that same case-study listing, the surcharge for stock that has sat between 241 and 270 days is $1.50 a cubic foot a month. From day 271, it's $5.45. For every 1,000 units, at the January-to-September storage rate, storage and surcharge together go, by our estimate, from $72.70 a month to $198.67. Nothing about the product changes on that day. Only its age. Our farmer would have recognised every one of these. Same shape. Drawn in dollars, in inches and in days instead of pounds.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16}, {"word": "weight", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.38}, {"word": "is", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.6}, {"word": "only", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.9}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.9, "end": 1.12}, {"word": "first", "start": 1.12, "end": 1.34}, {"word": "staircase.", "start": 1.34, "end": 1.8}, {"word": "The", "start": 2.44, "end": 2.7}, {"word": "fulfilment", "start": 2.7, "end": 3.1}, {"word": "fee", "start": 3.1, "end": 3.44}, {"word": "also", "start": 3.44, "end": 3.78}, {"word": "changes", "start": 3.78, "end": 4.26}, {"word": "with", "start": 4.26, "end": 4.52}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.52, "end": 4.66}, {"word": "price", "start": 4.66, "end": 4.94}, {"word": "you", "start": 4.94, "end": 5.14}, {"word": "charge:", "start": 5.14, "end": 5.5}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.16, "end": 6.26}, {"word": "card", "start": 6.26, "end": 6.52}, {"word": "has", "start": 6.52, "end": 6.74}, {"word": "edges", "st